00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:13.058
- What is going on?

00:08:13.058 --> 00:08:14.587
- [Kelly] Hi!

00:08:14.587 --> 00:08:16.187
Hi.
- Oh boy.

00:08:16.187 --> 00:08:17.158
