00:08:17.158 --> 00:08:18.658
- What's going on?

00:08:21.049 --> 00:08:21.882
- Hi!

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:25.963
Oh hey!

00:08:25.963 --> 00:08:26.796
Are you Troy?

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:29.790
- Yes.
- Are you Troy?

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:31.180
Oh my gosh buddy, hey.

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:32.970
- Hey.
- This one's for you, big dog.

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:33.803
Here you go.

00:08:35.165 --> 00:08:36.520
