00:09:14.270 --> 00:09:16.130
And then she was like oh,
marriage's a little big.

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:17.140
'Cause like, maybe we should enjoy like,

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:18.300
our lives, until we do that.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:20.370
And then it was like, magical
and we're all here now.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.380
Together!

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:23.316
It's great, and!

00:09:23.316 --> 00:09:24.588
♪ Cabana Boy Troy ♪

00:09:24.588 --> 00:09:27.095
♪ Such a frisker till it ain't even dark ♪

00:09:27.095 --> 00:09:28.423
♪ He's the Tim to your Faith ♪

00:09:28.423 --> 00:09:30.500
