Shannon says you're paying, so like,

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:32.990
can we all party with you?

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:34.657
Is that cool?
- Cool, yeah, yeah.

00:09:34.657 --> 00:09:39.657
♪ Cabana boy, cabana boy, cabana boy ♪

00:09:39.903 --> 00:09:41.983
♪ Cabana Boy Troy ♪

00:09:41.983 --> 00:09:43.466
- Yes!
(people cheering)

00:09:43.466 --> 00:09:46.018
That's ambush love song, people!

00:09:46.018 --> 00:09:48.168
(restaurant patrons clapping)

00:09:48.168 --> 00:09:50.550
That was our first
official ambush love song,

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:52.747
