- That was amazing.

00:09:52.747 --> 00:09:55.029
- Cabana Boy Troy, we
heard you like to party.

00:09:55.029 --> 00:09:57.266
- I will say, you guys are amazing.

00:09:57.266 --> 00:10:00.290
- That was all them.
- That was amazing.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:01.620
- Troy, I know it surprised you.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:03.580
Your face was awesome.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.900
I feel like you almost
were like, no I'm not Troy.

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:08.160
I don't know what's happening.

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:10.230
But did that surprise
give you all the feels?

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:13.690
- Oh yeah, that was uh, I don't know.

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:15.440
Thank you so much for doing this.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.060
I just wanna tell you thank you so much.

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:20.480
It is an honor, it's an
honor to be here with you,

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:22.040
with Wilson Phillips, with Ian.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:23.450
You guys are amazing, that we're even

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.393
sitting on this couch right now.

00:10:24.393 --> 00:10:25.880
- Hey, we are honored to have you.

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:27.510
You're the hero, you're
the one who saves lives,

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:29.268
and you're getting shot for us.

00:10:29.268 --> 00:10:30.941
(audience cheering)
You're the one we

00:10:30.941 --> 00:10:32.959
should be saying thank you!

00:10:32.959 --> 00:10:35.070
- Well, Tony's the hero too.

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.110
There's a lot of heroes out there,

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:37.310
and I think we all just are here

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:39.260
to be the best we can, right?

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:41.650
- Yeah, well we're
supposed to be doing that.

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:44.070
I don't know if everyone's following suit.

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:45.500
It's fine.
- It was an amazing surprise.

