00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:02.551
The Little Mermaid, kiss the girl.

00:11:02.551 --> 00:11:05.540
(audience cheering)
And I'm like, oh my God.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:07.590
- I mean, first of all, we're gonna have

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:09.720
to talk about this backstage, y'all.

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:11.320
Like I'm talkin' Little Mermaid?

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.564
- I love Disney.

00:11:13.564 --> 00:11:16.943
(audience laughing)

00:11:16.943 --> 00:11:18.713
- I feel challenged.

00:11:19.550 --> 00:11:22.185
I feel like my husband, I
feel challenged to this.

00:11:22.185 --> 00:11:23.018
So you have something that you

00:11:23.018 --> 00:11:25.140
wanna tell Shannon though, right?

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:30.140
- Um, so, I've always been a
person who is there for people

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:35.630
and helping people, and
I love my role in life.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.083
But when the person that.

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.130
- [Kelly] You're supposed
to feel like this,

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:40.963
that's all right.

00:11:40.963 --> 00:11:41.796
- [Troy] Oh God.

00:11:41.796 --> 00:11:42.629
- Oh it's all right, it's all right.

00:11:42.629 --> 00:11:43.550
Check that out, whoo.
- [Troy] I think I need a hug.

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:44.943
- I'm like a magician.

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.890
- But when the person I
cherish the most in the world

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.700
puts out that much effort, and helps me

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:54.340
through all this stuff,
I don't know what to do.

00:11:54.340 --> 00:11:55.428
It's amazing.

00:11:55.428 --> 00:11:57.618
- Aww, y'all are so good.

00:11:57.618 --> 00:12:00.561
(audience cheering)
Oh we can share, we can share.

00:12:00.561 --> 00:12:02.291
There's more.

00:12:02.291 --> 00:12:03.959
I love you!

00:12:03.959 --> 00:12:05.426
- I need a hug from Ian.

00:12:05.426 --> 00:12:07.680
(audience laughing)

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:08.693
- You are precious.

00:12:08.693 --> 00:12:11.010
Get in there, get in there!

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:12.863
- That's good, that's good.

00:12:12.863 --> 00:12:15.167
- You kick ass.
- Thank you.

00:12:15.167 --> 00:12:16.549
- My gosh, I love it!

00:12:16.549 --> 00:12:20.508
Well, we have one more
surprise for the both of you.

00:12:20.508 --> 00:12:22.560
- Don't worry, this one won't scare you.

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:24.730
