00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:36.000
So enjoy all-inclusive amenities,

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:39.390
including international dining,
bottomless cocktails, eh!

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:42.760
And nightly entertainment set
along sweeping ocean views.

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:44.540
Y'all, it's time for a break, but I hope

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:45.780
y'all have so much fun, I'm coming.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:46.936
I'm gonna serenade y'all there, too.

00:12:46.936 --> 00:12:47.786
I'm just kidding!

